From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zrmnelson <104142635+zrmnelson@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:45:36 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 09/19] qml: Omarchy motion, mark and flat surfaces

OmarchyTheme watches Omarchy's no-animations flag; MainCtx exposes omarchyStyle and
omarchyAnimations. VLCStyle durations are capped at 300 ms in an Omarchy build and
become 0 when animations are off. Ease-in, ease-in-out and bounce curves become
ease-out, and the floating notification no longer scales from zero. The cone in the
top bars and the empty state is replaced by an accent-tinted play mark, the play
button is a flat accent ring on theme surfaces, keyboard focus is drawn in the accent,
and the stock palettes' pure black/white outer surfaces follow the theme.
